<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>PRACTICALLY ZERO RECOIL MP5 HOLOSIGHT</Major>
    <Description>This is probably one of the best free scripts for the MP5 recoil in Rust. It requires minimal manual assistance, and can consistantly beam from 100+ meters.

Settings this scrip was tested on:
0.66 in game sensitivity
90 FOV (Field of View/Vision)
1000 DPI
</Description>
